  <rdf:Description rdf:about="" xmlns:pdf="http://ns.adobe.com/pdf/1.3/">
   <pdf:Author>Aditya_Sharma_Data_Engineering_Manager_PepsiCo_10.2Years</pdf:Author>
   <pdf:Keywords>Technical Skills: Data Governance, ETL/ELT, Teradata, Hadoop, HDFS, Kafka, Apache Spark, Airflow, Salesforce, Hive, Data Quality.
Cloud Skill: Azure Data Factory, Azure Databricks, Data Modelling, Serverless SQL DB, Synapse.
Soft Skills: Positive Attitude, Enthusiastic, Ambitious, Problem Solver, Credibility, Commitment, Accountability.
Deployment Skills: CI-CD, Azure DevOps, Dev-SecOps, JIRA.
Data Engineering Tools: SSMS, Erwin Tool, Apace Kafka, Azure tech stack, Data Modelling.
Programming Languages: Python, Java, SQL, Scala.</pdf:Keywords>
