   <rms:rms_experience_0_description>Proposed migration plan for GWS project (Global Workspaces), to move the legacy on-premise data to Azure cloud, reducing security and compliance risk by 70%.
Championed the design of Azure Solutions and infrastructures for 3.9k clients using Databricks,  Python, Pyspark, SQL , Data Modeling and Java.
Managed 11+ folks as subject lead,  ensuring they delivered project 15% under the project and in compliance with the deadline.
Provided technical expertise to 15 sales team members during proposal discussions and presentations to customers; achieved a 70% success rate for deals closed.</rms:rms_experience_0_description>
