   <rms:rms_experience_1_description>Built data pipelines which enhanced data movement from SAP to Gold layer using ADF and CI-CD for versioning, increasing the data load by 30%. Spearheaded Labor-Cost Forecast tool project, predicting 95% data using Random Forest AI and ML models.
Leveraged systems table In Databricks to understand cost utilization and compare costs for job, interactive, SQL warehouse and serverless compute.
Implemented unity catalogue to enhance data lineage and governance by migrating from hive meta store to UC enabled tables.
Reduced 1.2M $ capex and operational costs for the company, by migrating towards serverless compute. 
Calculated the realizations for compute costs by recommending the optimal clusters for every projects across PepsiCo. Realized 0.8M $ for last half yearly savings. Derived Observability dashboard to showcase Cluster cost by compute, workspaces, environments, Sectors which gives management holistic view on resource costing.</rms:rms_experience_1_description>
