   <rms:rms_experience_4_description>Designed and managed Hive tables using HiveQL, handling and analyzing over 5 TB of data to support data-driven decision-making across organizational projects. 
Leveraged Big Data technologies including Apache Spark, HDFS, and Hive to process and optimize workflows for 25+ PB of data annually, resulting in a 15% reduction in operational costs and improved efficiency.
Spearheaded Labor-Cost Forecast tool project, predicting 95% data using Random Forest AI and ML models.</rms:rms_experience_4_description>
